docs {
  # Get Vehicle Detail By ID

  This request is used to get vehicle detail by `id`. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has a protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Vehicle ID  | 4f33d5e4-de9f-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — vehicle fetched successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "vehicle fetched successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "4f33d5e4-de9f-11ed-b5ea-0242ac120002",
      "vehicle_name": "Kijang Innova 2.0 Type G MT",
      "vehicle_merk": "Toyota",
      "vehicle_type": "Minibus",
      "vehicle_price": 275000000,
      "vehicle_desc": "sudah jarang digunakan 2",
      "vehicle_distance": 90000,
      "vehicle_category": "Parents Car",
      "vehicle_status": "Available",
      "vehicle_year_made": 2011,
      "vehicle_plate_number": "PA 1060 VZ",
      "vehicle_fuel_status": "Not Monitored",
      "vehicle_fuel_capacity": 50,
      "vehicle_default_fuel": "Pertamina Pertalite",
      "vehicle_color": "White",
      "vehicle_transmission": "Manual",
      "vehicle_img_url": null,
      "vehicle_other_img_url": null,
      "vehicle_capacity": 8,
      "vehicle_document": [
        {
          "id": "fL9eDk",
          "attach_type": "attachment_image",
          "attach_name": "ini gambar",
          "attach_url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/..."
        }
      ],
      "created_at": "2024-03-27 04:03:34",
      "updated_at": "2025-07-08 02:13:45",
      "deleted_at": null
    }
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — vehicle failed to fetched**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "vehicle not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}